    "id": "stillCapture",
    "label": "Still Capture Settings",
    "toolTip": "Configure cross-platform still image capture with support for multiple output formats. Enables capturing high-resolution still frames from the video stream and saving them in JPEG, PNG, RAW, or BMP formats across Windows, Linux, and other platforms. Allows format selection for codec compatibility and file format choice for different use cases.",
    "expanded": false,
    "visible": true,
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "stillFormat",
        "label": "Format: ",
        "toolTip": "Select video codec format for still capture encoding. ",
